, verified parsers are often based on formalisms that are not expressive enough to capture the full definition of valid input for a given application. Specifications of many real-world data formats include both a syntactic component and one or more non-context-free semantic properties that a well-formed instance of the format must exhibit. A parser for context-free grammars (CFGs) cannot determine on its own whether an input is valid according to such a specification; it must be supplemented with additional validation checks.\",\nisbn=\"978-3-031-33170-1\"\n}"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":"container"},{"t":"str","v":"NASA Formal Methods"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":"doi"},{"t":"str","v":"10.1007/978-3-031-33170-1_25"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":"entry-type"},{"t":"str","v":"inproceedings"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":"pages"},{"t":"str","v":"414--429"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":"publisher"},{"t":"str","v":"Springer Nature Switzerland"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":"venue"},{"t":"str","v":"nfm"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":"visibility"},{"t":"str","v":"public"}]},{"relation":"meta","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":"year"},{"t":"int","v":2023}]},{"relation":"path","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":"entries/refs/lasserCoStar2023/lasserCoStar2023.hel"}]},{"relation":"reference","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":"inproceedings"},{"t":"int","v":2023}]},{"relation":"reference-pdf","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":""}]},{"relation":"tag","args":[{"t":"entry","v":"lasserCoStar2023"},{"t":"str","v":"parsi